# game/script.rpy:5
translate chinese_simplified start_a26666b2:

    # system "This game contains mature, adult content that is intended for an 18+ audience only."
    system "该游戏包含成人内容，仅供 18 岁以上观众使用。"

# game/script.rpy:6
translate chinese_simplified start_519bde51:

    # system "By playing this game, you agree that you are 18 years of age or older."
    system "玩此游戏即表示您同意您已年满 18 岁。"

# game/script.rpy:7
translate chinese_simplified start_4e8a269c:

    # system "If you are not 18 years of age or older, please exit the game now."
    system "如果您未满 18 周岁，请立即退出游戏。"

# game/script.rpy:9
translate chinese_simplified start_d1536767:

    # system "By clicking 'I agree', you confirm that you are 18 years of age or older." nointeract
    system "点击“我同意”即表示您确认您已年满 18 岁。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:11
translate chinese_simplified start_44bdb198:

    # system "Okay then, let's get started!"
    system "好吧，让我们开始吧！"

# game/script.rpy:20
translate chinese_simplified start_d1f798f2:

    # "I just moved to a new city to start my career as an indie game developer."
    "我刚刚搬到一个新城市，开始我作为独立游戏开发者的职业生涯。"

# game/script.rpy:21
translate chinese_simplified start_7af065ac:

    # "Until recently, I was living with my parents and working a corporate job that I hated."
    "直到最近，我还和父母住在一起，做着一份我讨厌的公司工作。"

# game/script.rpy:22
translate chinese_simplified start_098d1f53:

    # "I decided to take a leap of faith and move to a new city to pursue my dream of making games."
    "我决定迈出信念的一步，搬到一个新的城市去追求我制作游戏的梦想。"

# game/script.rpy:23
translate chinese_simplified start_516b947f:

    # "Money is tight though, so I decided to take advantage of the extra room in my apartment and find a roommate."
    "不过钱很紧张，所以我决定利用公寓里多余的房间找一个室友。"

# game/script.rpy:25
translate chinese_simplified start_cf4e5812:

    # "I put up an ad online and got a decent amount of responses, but none of them really panned out."
    "我在网上发布了一个广告并得到了相当多的回应，但没有一个真正成功。"

# game/script.rpy:26
translate chinese_simplified start_c4c9f887:

    # "There was this one guy who I thought was perfect. He didn't try to haggle over rent and said he wouldn't even be home often."
    "有一个我认为是完美的人。他没有试图讨价还价，并表示他甚至不会经常回家。"

# game/script.rpy:27
translate chinese_simplified start_a82f85af:

    # "But turns out he just wanted to use the apartment as a drug den where he could stash his weed and have his friends over all the time."
    "但事实证明，他只是想把公寓用作毒品窝点，在那里他可以藏匿大麻，并随时邀请他的朋友过来。"

# game/script.rpy:28
translate chinese_simplified start_2c2b7240:

    # "Another couple asked if I would be willing to join their polyamorous relationship as a third partner."
    "另一对夫妇问我是否愿意作为第三个伴侣加入他们的多角恋关系。"

# game/script.rpy:29
translate chinese_simplified start_384a76d5:

    # "Of course, I declined."
    "当然，我拒绝了。"

# game/script.rpy:30
translate chinese_simplified start_6e149907:

    # "I just wanted a normal roommate that I would get along with and wouldn't cause any trouble."
    "我只是想要一个正常的室友，能和我相处，不会惹出任何麻烦。"

# game/script.rpy:31
translate chinese_simplified start_2749f60f:

    # "After a few hours and a headache, I finally found a person that looked decent."
    "经过几个小时的头痛之后，我终于找到了一个看起来还不错的人。"

# game/script.rpy:33
translate chinese_simplified start_e67b695a:

    # "His name was Robin."
    "他的名字叫罗宾。"

# game/script.rpy:34
translate chinese_simplified start_0aff7e7d:

    # "Based on our conversation, I could sort of tell he was an introvert, which would be perfect since I don't want a loud roommate."
    "根据我们的谈话，我可以看出他是一个内向的人，这将是完美的，因为我不想要一个吵闹的室友。"

# game/script.rpy:35
translate chinese_simplified start_6119c686:

    # "He was also willing to move in right away."
    "他也愿意立即搬进去。"

# game/script.rpy:36
translate chinese_simplified start_13af98a2:

    # "Just to be safe though, I asked him to send me a picture of himself along with ID before taking a deposit."
    "不过为了安全起见，我要求他在收取押金之前给我发一张他自己的照片和身份证。"

# game/script.rpy:38
translate chinese_simplified start_d837d04c:

    # "He sent a photo of himself and, to my surprise, he looked more like a girl than a guy."
    "他发了一张自己的照片，令我惊讶的是，他看起来更像一个女孩而不是一个男人。"

# game/script.rpy:40
translate chinese_simplified start_fd7438f2:

    # "He had curly black hair, a small, pointed face, and a soft, feminine looking body. His eyes were light blue and his lips were full and pouty."
    "他有一头卷曲的黑发，一张小而尖的脸，以及柔软、女性化的身体。他的眼睛是浅蓝色的，嘴唇丰满而撅起。"

# game/script.rpy:41
translate chinese_simplified start_190f0c50:

    # "After looking at the photo, I wasn't quite sure what to think."
    "看完照片后，我不太确定该怎么想。"

# game/script.rpy:42
translate chinese_simplified start_cf154383:

    # "He definitely didn't look like any of the other guys I interviewed, and his appearance was very ambiguous."
    "他看起来绝对不像我采访过的其他人，而且他的外表很暧昧。"

# game/script.rpy:43
translate chinese_simplified start_30c556dc:

    # "However, it's not like I'm looking for a roommate based on their looks, and he seemed like a perfectly nice guy over our messages."
    "然而，我并不是根据长相来寻找室友的，而且从我们的信息来看，他似乎是一个非常好的人。"

# game/script.rpy:45
translate chinese_simplified start_2fa4bf8f:

    # "Today is his move-in day."
    "今天是他搬入的日子。"

# game/script.rpy:48
translate chinese_simplified start_b3f3453c:

    # "I'm waiting outside of the apartment building for Robin to arrive."
    "我在公寓楼外等待罗宾的到来。"

# game/script.rpy:49
translate chinese_simplified start_bce81262:

    # pro "He should be here any minute now."
    pro "他现在随时都应该在这里。"

# game/script.rpy:50
translate chinese_simplified start_dc56ccbb:

    # "I figured it would make a good first impression to greet him at the door and help him move his stuff in."
    "我认为在门口迎接他并帮助他搬东西会给人留下良好的第一印象。"

# game/script.rpy:52
translate chinese_simplified start_967594a5:

    # "After a few minutes, a car pulls up."
    "几分钟后，一辆车停了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:53
translate chinese_simplified start_d6264076:

    # pro "This must be him."
    pro "这一定是他。"

# game/script.rpy:58
translate chinese_simplified start_c30e47d8:

    # "Robin steps out of the car wearing a black cropped hoodie and shorts."
    "罗宾穿着黑色短款连帽衫和短裤从车里走出来。"

# game/script.rpy:59
translate chinese_simplified start_cdb9490f:

    # "His clothes hugged his thin figure tightly and I could see the shape of his hips and chest."
    "他的衣服紧紧地包裹着他瘦弱的身材，我可以看到他臀部和胸部的形状。"

# game/script.rpy:60
translate chinese_simplified start_e87b5003:

    # "I felt a little nervous as he walked towards me, I've never met someone who looked like him before."
    "当他向我走来时，我感到有点紧张，我以前从未见过像他这样的人。"

# game/script.rpy:61
translate chinese_simplified start_e976a923:

    # pro "Hey! Are you Robin?"
    pro "嘿！你是罗宾吗？"

# game/script.rpy:62
translate chinese_simplified start_58c0639d:

    # voice voiceline1
    # robin "Yeah, h-hi."
    voice voiceline1
    robin "是的，嗨。"

# game/script.rpy:64
translate chinese_simplified start_2469f00b:

    # pro "It's nice to meet you. I'm [protagonist_name]."
    pro "很高兴认识你。我是[protagonist_name]。"

# game/script.rpy:65
translate chinese_simplified start_03af5f79:

    # voice voiceline2
    # robin "It's nice to meet you too!"
    voice voiceline2
    robin "很高兴认识你！"

# game/script.rpy:67
translate chinese_simplified start_072c89b2:

    # pro "Is this all the stuff you're bringing? I can help you take it inside."
    pro "这就是你带来的所有东西吗？我可以帮你把它搬进去。"

# game/script.rpy:69
translate chinese_simplified start_c565c459:

    # voice voiceline3
    # robin "Oh don't worry about it, I can handle it myself."
    voice voiceline3
    robin "噢，你不用担心，我自己能处理好。"

# game/script.rpy:71
translate chinese_simplified start_bb5869e9:

    # pro "I insist."
    pro "我坚持。"

# game/script.rpy:73
translate chinese_simplified start_70e4b7e7:

    # voice voiceline4
    # robin "Oh... okay."
    voice voiceline4
    robin "哦好的。"

# game/script.rpy:76
translate chinese_simplified start_9632bdc3:

    # "He softly smiles for a moment before turning around to grab his bag."
    "他轻轻地笑了一会儿，然后转身去抓包。"

# game/script.rpy:77
translate chinese_simplified start_6b88c189:

    # "As he grabbed his bags, his shorts slightly slipped down."
    "当他抓起包时，他的短裤微微滑了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:78
translate chinese_simplified start_e1341e80:

    # voice voiceline5
    # robin "I only have two boxes to bring to my room, so we can each take one if you'd like..."
    voice voiceline5
    robin "我只有两个盒子可以带到我的房间，所以如果你愿意的话我们可以每人拿一个......"

# game/script.rpy:80
translate chinese_simplified start_c46f6f4b:

    # pro "Uh... for sure."
    pro "呃……当然。"

# game/script.rpy:81
translate chinese_simplified start_a8db3472:

    # "Even his voice is super feminine, it's almost surprising that he's actually a guy."
    "尽管他的声音非常女性化，但令人惊讶的是他实际上是个男人。"

# game/script.rpy:83
translate chinese_simplified start_1c64b542:

    # "I pick up one of the boxes and take it inside."
    "我拿起其中一个盒子，把它放进去。"

# game/script.rpy:86
translate chinese_simplified start_2a248567:

    # pro "So Robin, where did you live before this?"
    pro "那么罗宾，在此之前你住在哪里？"

# game/script.rpy:87
translate chinese_simplified start_f9c909df:

    # voice voiceline6
    # robin "I lived in New York City, in an apartment."
    voice voiceline6
    robin "我住在纽约市的一间公寓里。"

# game/script.rpy:89
translate chinese_simplified start_792e9ee2:

    # pro "New York!? Why would you ever want to leave that place!?"
    pro "纽约！？你为什么想离开那个地方！？"

# game/script.rpy:90
translate chinese_simplified start_0284397a:

    # voice voiceline7
    # robin "Oh, uh..."
    voice voiceline7
    robin "哦，呃..."

# game/script.rpy:93
translate chinese_simplified start_e325e108:

    # voice voiceline8
    # robin "I guess a change of pace would be the best way to describe it."
    voice voiceline8
    robin "我想节奏的变化是描述它的最好方式。"

# game/script.rpy:95
translate chinese_simplified start_48213e3e:

    # pro "A change of pace?"
    pro "改变节奏？"

# game/script.rpy:97
translate chinese_simplified start_d0c34081:

    # voice voiceline9
    # robin "Yeah..."
    voice voiceline9
    robin "是的..."

# game/script.rpy:99
translate chinese_simplified start_43c9059f:

    # voice voiceline10
    # robin "I, um, just needed a quiet place for my career."
    voice voiceline10
    robin "我，嗯，只是需要一个安静的地方来发展我的职业生涯。"

# game/script.rpy:101
translate chinese_simplified start_d2fc0434:

    # voice voiceline11
    # robin "Somewhere where I don't have to worry about the problems that come with a big city."
    voice voiceline11
    robin "在那里我不必担心大城市带来的问题。"

# game/script.rpy:103
translate chinese_simplified start_3a775df7:

    # pro "Oh that makes sense."
    pro "哦，这是有道理的。"

# game/script.rpy:104
translate chinese_simplified start_eea1ce3b:

    # pro "I've never really lived in a big city before, so I guess I wouldn't know what it's like."
    pro "我以前从未真正在大城市生活过，所以我想我不知道大城市是什么样的。"

# game/script.rpy:105
translate chinese_simplified start_0b6b382d:

    # voice voiceline12
    # robin "It's not all bad, but it's definitely not for everyone."
    voice voiceline12
    robin "这并不全是坏事，但绝对不适合所有人。"

# game/script.rpy:107
translate chinese_simplified start_420bb9ed:

    # pro "I can imagine."
    pro "我可以想象。"

# game/script.rpy:109
translate chinese_simplified start_549333f9:

    # "We set down the boxes in his room while continuing our conversation."
    "我们一边把箱子放在他的房间里，一边继续交谈。"

# game/script.rpy:111
translate chinese_simplified start_0d3f177d:

    # pro "So what do you do for work?"
    pro "那么你做什么工作呢？"

# game/script.rpy:112
translate chinese_simplified start_0ee723c5:

    # voice voiceline13
    # robin "I uh..."
    voice voiceline13
    robin "我呃..."

# game/script.rpy:114
translate chinese_simplified start_efafffc3:

    # voice voiceline14
    # robin "W-work from home."
    voice voiceline14
    robin "W-在家工作。"

# game/script.rpy:116
translate chinese_simplified start_03d69cac:

    # pro "Oh that's convenient, I'm in the same sort of situation myself."
    pro "呵呵，这个方便啊，我自己也是这样的情况。"

# game/script.rpy:117
translate chinese_simplified start_d4d32ad5:

    # pro "I'm an indie game dev, so I basically can work from wherever I want provided I have my computer and an internet connection."
    pro "我是一名独立游戏开发者，所以只要我有电脑和互联网连接，我基本上可以在任何我想要的地方工作。"

# game/script.rpy:119
translate chinese_simplified start_d8c089ef:

    # voice voiceline15
    # robin "Wow, that's so cool!"
    voice voiceline15
    robin "哇，太酷了！"

# game/script.rpy:121
translate chinese_simplified start_4f42f31f:

    # voice voiceline16
    # robin "A game developer seems like a dream job to be honest."
    voice voiceline16
    robin "老实说，游戏开发人员似乎是一份梦想的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:123
translate chinese_simplified start_4e92ab7a:

    # pro "Eh, it's alright. Not the most stable career I could be in, but I've always wanted to make games and I finally got my opportunity to do so."
    pro "呃，没关系。这不是我能从事的最稳定的职业，但我一直想制作游戏，而且我终于得到了这样做的机会。"

# game/script.rpy:124
translate chinese_simplified start_df40652f:

    # voice voiceline17
    # robin "What were you doing before this?"
    voice voiceline17
    robin "在此之前你在做什么？"

# game/script.rpy:126
translate chinese_simplified start_c7e3aeb3:

    # pro "I was working as a software engineer for a big tech company."
    pro "我在一家大型科技公司担任软件工程师。"

# game/script.rpy:127
translate chinese_simplified start_ef47dfa2:

    # pro "I didn't like the corporate environment, so I decided to go indie and make my own games."
    pro "我不喜欢公司环境，所以我决定独立制作自己的游戏。"

# game/script.rpy:128
translate chinese_simplified start_12532baa:

    # voice voiceline18
    # robin "That's really brave of you."
    voice voiceline18
    robin "你真是勇敢啊。"

# game/script.rpy:130
translate chinese_simplified start_ab4f135f:

    # pro "Thanks, I guess."
    pro "谢谢，我想。"

# game/script.rpy:132
translate chinese_simplified start_a8ce8053:

    # "We finished unpacking Robin's belongings."
    "我们完成了罗宾的物品的拆箱。"

# game/script.rpy:135
translate chinese_simplified start_d881c139:

    # voice voiceline19
    # robin "Thank you for your help [protagonist_name]."
    voice voiceline19
    robin "感谢您的帮助[protagonist_name]。"

# game/script.rpy:137
translate chinese_simplified start_155288c7:

    # voice voiceline20
    # robin "I really appreciate it, I've never really moved to a new place all on my own before so I was a little nervous."
    voice voiceline20
    robin "我真的很感激，我以前从来没有真正独自搬到一个新的地方，所以我有点紧张。"

# game/script.rpy:139
translate chinese_simplified start_5fefea31:

    # pro "No problem! Is there anything else you need help with?"
    pro "没问题！您还有什么需要帮助的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:141
translate chinese_simplified start_f5d9e168:

    # voice voiceline21
    # robin "Um, no I think that was everything..."
    voice voiceline21
    robin "嗯，不，我认为这就是一切......"

# game/script.rpy:144
translate chinese_simplified start_5835cd3b:

    # pro "Well if you need anything, I'll be in my room."
    pro "好吧，如果你需要什么，我会在我的房间里。"

# game/script.rpy:145
translate chinese_simplified start_de544ff9:

    # voice voiceline22
    # robin "O-okay. I'll let you know if I do."
    voice voiceline22
    robin "哦，好吧。如果我这样做的话我会告诉你的。"

# game/script.rpy:147
translate chinese_simplified start_a4e049ca:

    # pro "Nice meeting you Robin!"
    pro "很高兴认识你罗宾！"

# game/script.rpy:148
translate chinese_simplified start_18ea6b47:

    # pro "I think we'll get along just fine."
    pro "我想我们会相处得很好。"

# game/script.rpy:150
translate chinese_simplified start_5fdc5442:

    # voice voiceline23
    # robin "Nice meeting you too!"
    voice voiceline23
    robin "认识你也很高兴！"

# game/script.rpy:153
translate chinese_simplified start_bc93f35f:

    # "Robin smiled at me before I turned and walked back to my room."
    "罗宾对我微笑，然后我转身走回我的房间。"

# game/script.rpy:155
translate chinese_simplified start_8f2a8261:

    # "I'm glad he seems like a nice person, but his appearance and demeanor really caught me off guard."
    "我很高兴他看起来是个好人，但他的外表和举止确实让我措手不及。"

# game/script.rpy:156
translate chinese_simplified start_45e9ec9f:

    # "He also seemed weirdly vague about why he moved and his career, am I sure he's not some serial killer looking for his next victim?"
    "他对于他搬家的原因和他的职业生涯似乎也很奇怪，我确定他不是一个正在寻找下一个受害者的连环杀手吗？"

# game/script.rpy:157
translate chinese_simplified start_e988b9e5:

    # "But then again, he seemed pretty nervous to move here so maybe he was just being awkward or shy."
    "但话又说回来，他似乎对搬到这里感到非常紧张，所以也许他只是感到尴尬或害羞。"

# game/script.rpy:158
translate chinese_simplified start_e8ed8bb2:

    # "And he is going to be living with me for who knows how long, so it would be best for the both of us to just get along well."
    "而且他要和我住在一起不知道要多久，所以我们俩最好相处得很好。"

# game/script.rpy:159
translate chinese_simplified start_bcd2a5c1:

    # "It's strange though. He acts like a girl and he's very pretty like one too. The way he acts is... cute. Almost like a fembo-"
    "不过这很奇怪。他的行为举止就像一个女孩，而且他也非常漂亮。他的行为方式很……可爱。几乎就像一个febo-"

# game/script.rpy:160
translate chinese_simplified start_805e41bc:

    # pro "Nope! No. That's inappropriate and weird to think about."
    pro "没有！不，这样想是不合适和奇怪的。"

# game/script.rpy:163
translate chinese_simplified start_e953eec0:

    # "I decide to get some work done for the day."
    "我决定完成今天的一些工作。"

# game/script.rpy:171
translate chinese_simplified start_ac4459be:

    # pro "Ah shit, my back..."
    pro "哎呀，我的背……"

# game/script.rpy:172
translate chinese_simplified start_2a674f6d:

    # "I've been working on my project for a few hours and it's starting to get late."
    "我已经在我的项目上工作了几个小时，但已经开始晚了。"

# game/script.rpy:173
translate chinese_simplified start_f1559be7:

    # "Maybe I should take a break to grab some dinner."
    "也许我应该休息一下，吃点晚饭。"

# game/script.rpy:174
translate chinese_simplified start_61f77c14:

    # pro "I wonder if Robin wants to join me, it could give us a chance to get more comfortable with each other as roommates."
    pro "我想知道罗宾是否愿意加入我，这可以让我们有机会作为室友彼此相处得更融洽。"

# game/script.rpy:175
translate chinese_simplified start_4a3c79df:

